{"title":"Exchange Clerk","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Exchange Clerk is a townsperson who trades — a named <a href=\"#/monster/human\">Human</a> seen at level 1.</p>\n      <h2>Wearing</h2><p>The <a href=\"#/guide/outfits\">Merchant</a> outfit, and</p><div class=\"gear-line\"><span class=\"gear-piece\"><i>head</i> Feathered Cap Green</span><span class=\"gear-piece\"><i>torso</i> Fine Shirt Green</span><span class=\"gear-piece\"><i>legs</i> Fine Trousers</span><span class=\"gear-piece\"><i>feet</i> Buckled Shoes</span><span class=\"gear-piece\"><i>off hand</i> Scribing Quill</span></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find Exchange Clerk</h2>\n      \n      <ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Binxonia\">Binxonia</a></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Wispmeyer\">Wispmeyer</a></li></ul>\n      \n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"exchange-clerk\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Other named Humans</h2><p><a href=\"#/npc/binxonia-guard\">Binxonia Guard</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/banker\">Banker</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/stablemaster\">Stablemaster</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/mining-trainer\">Mining Trainer</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/james-hookman\">James Hookman</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/harbormaster-orla-quayle\">Harbormaster Orla Quayle</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/ada-fen\">Ada Fen</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/mira\">Mira</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/ellis-pike\">Ellis Pike</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/hollis-tamber\">Hollis Tamber</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/nessa-holt\">Nessa Holt</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/gerald-seabroden\">Gerald Seabroden</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/fishing-trainer\">Fishing Trainer</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/lumberjack-trainer\">Lumberjack Trainer</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/osric-blane\">Osric Blane</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/archery-vendor\">Archery Vendor</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/sergeant-ilsa-varne\">Sergeant Ilsa Varne</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/linnet-birch\">Linnet Birch</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/bloomgua